{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"4361da77bee0e5f3829a413cac10db6d293f835e1c53ad754a2e0383cebeff31","ja":"ファンが望むこと","zh":"粉丝所期望的事宜","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2f14dfe835d5cab3c0ef640025ed43818e1b9b2385d3978ff3929eb8afe40f36","ja":"静香ちゃん、考えすぎちゃってるんじゃないかな？\nリラックスして考えた方が……。","zh":"静香是不是想太多了呢？\n放轻松一点去想或许会比较好……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"723d5f197f1409d4e1a21d8108fb3265b4f755fe7c33b53c81291ca580a71e01","ja":"で、でも……このまま決まらなかったら、\nイベントができなくなってしまいますし……！","zh":"可、可是……要是再这样定不下来的话，\n活动就办不成了呀……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"37cddf7074170627166bcaddd344a935228e9b748b9397d185642c54fa0acbe5","ja":"考え込まなくても、静香ちゃんがすごく楽しめる\nイベントにしたら大丈夫だと思うよ。","zh":"只要办成静香也能玩得非常开心、\n不用去苦思冥想的活动，我觉得就没问题的哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0d93062a30a6b4bdfde3c80fc5bb3157ca3eec6a9db8e462d52c283340d1acfe","ja":"そうだよ！　ファンの人達って、きっと静香の\n楽しそうな姿も見にきてくれるんだと思う！","zh":"就是说嘛！粉丝们肯定也想来\n看看静香乐在其中的样子！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"a5edef1502086ed7b268f8c8481565bb4f54910a8cdb83eaab74c8ff4efd809e","ja":"静香ちゃんは、お花見公演で\n自分だけ楽しんじゃったって言ってたけど。","zh":"静香虽然在赏花公演上说\n只有自己一个人乐在其中。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4221d60434d016055f9bcb36f27164dba46b97069fe55196275bb871387965ad","ja":"きっとそのときも、ファンの人達は\n静香ちゃんと同じくらい幸せだったんじゃないかな？","zh":"那时粉丝们想必也\n和静香一样幸福吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"c6d3b30713e976db000c734bbcda1401d89da6610a3216ee0abd8a46da9d2eb4","ja":"！　私が楽しむことで、ファンのみなさんが……。\nじゃ、じゃあ、例えば……。","zh":"！只要我乐在其中，粉丝们就会……\n那、那么，比如说……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"c7af661fd3958283f4709ca9736b550f98d31489580756f46c4be9284fda7bce","ja":"ファンのみなさんからリクエスト曲を聞いて\nカバーする……なんて内容でもいいんでしょうか？","zh":"向各位粉丝征集想听翻唱的曲目\n然后进行翻唱……这种内容也可以吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"435a74175287f4196f5b11b07568b5d87a193724169b4bb2c99adfbf18559157","ja":"うん、それすっごくいいと思う！\n絶対盛り上がるよ！","zh":"嗯，我觉得那样特别好！\n气氛绝对能热烈起来的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"53f6392c225012b855414fd6090be54ddefd20bbfd034e0d39bfec40b52b8456","ja":"……ありがとうございます！\nやっと答えが見つかった気がします。","zh":"……非常感谢！\n我感觉终于找到答案了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e","ja":"数日後……","zh":"几天后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"be11c781efe9f8396070240f2bf40fb440ee6767e63f8752110c57cc92b62aa7","ja":"静香ちゃんへのリクエスト曲、\nたくさん集まってるみたいだね♪","zh":"给静香的点播歌曲，\n好像收集到了很多呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"a338df850bec3b7b2a31f51612c7c8d2d42b1d27af184fc58230e4e7c4067547","ja":"はい！　まさかこんなに反響があるなんて……\nイベント当日が待ちきれません！","zh":"好的！真没想到会有这么大的反响……\n我已经迫不及待想等到活动当天了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"acff8ee87ce93eec13e455a490279dfdcf3856088d419f02919f0cff3d0df2a2","ja":"でも、どれを選べばいいか迷ってしまって……。\nみなさんの気持ちに応えたいんです！","zh":"可是，我都不知道该选哪个才好了……\n我很想回应大家的心意！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"08b845548f38fa9bb9b6dd67887c7be84625987c2dd2cc40245267333ba206b8","ja":"あの、全部の曲を歌いたいんですけど、\nいいでしょうか？","zh":"那个，我想把所有的歌曲都唱一遍，\n可以吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"5f7051f37bb17af634f0bbb65042405771fab3400f244bf2f440632d491cec20","ja":"へぇ～、全部か。すごいな……。","zh":"哎～，全都是啊。真厉害……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"5cfe3d9e374d8f821e9039a9625ec7e8dde360977bc4ab7cf76b5d0e2a4bfa59","ja":"って、ええ～っ！？\nさすがにそれは無理なんじゃないかな！？","zh":"等、诶诶～！？\n再怎么说那也太勉强了吧！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1166.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"ce3214d6b0e1fe01fe9aeb8f3f708f04236397810693cba1f65dcff9dc1099e8","ja":"そ、そうだよね、時間も限られてるし。\nよ、よかったら、一緒に選ばない……？","zh":"也、也是呢，毕竟时间也有限。\n要、要是可以的话，要不要一起挑……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
